     1611   field contract-code as integer
     1612   field exch-code     as integer
     1613   field gds-code      as integer
     1614   field vat-pc        as decimal
     1615   field vat-type      as character
     1616   field prc           as decimal
     1617   field price-cli     as decimal
     1618   field status_       as character
     1619   index pi
